 '<h2>Why MetaTrader 4 is Still King in GCC</h2>
<p>Despite the launch of MT5, MetaTrader 4 remains the most widely used trading platform in the GCC and MENA region. It offers Arabic-language support, a massive library of Expert Advisors (EAs), and a familiar interface that traders trust. If you are looking for a broker with MT4 in UAE, Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, or Qatar — all brokers in our list above offer it.</p>
<h2>MT4 Features That Gulf Traders Love</h2>
<ul>
