<li><strong>Expert Advisors (EAs)</strong> — automated trading systems compatible with thousands of EAs</li>
<li><strong>One-click trading</strong> — fast execution from charts</li>
<li><strong>Custom indicators</strong> — full MQL4 scripting language</li>
<li><strong>Mobile apps</strong> — iOS and Android with Arabic interface</li>
<li><strong>Free demo account</strong> — practice with all MT4 features risk-free</li>
